        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://centralmontana.com/communities/martinsdale/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Musselshell River borders the town’s southern edge and is known for consistently good fishing.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 2"
      ],
