      ],
      "source": "https://centralmontana.com/communities/martinsdale/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Bair Family Museum, housed in Charles Bair’s former ranch house, showcases turn‑of‑the‑century art, furniture, and Native American artwork.",
